00:00:33.240 --> 00:00:39.440
continued to expand its operational domain. Multiple cybercabs were filmed operating in downtown

00:00:39.440 --> 00:00:45.500
Austin traffic, handling employee shuttles and curbside pickups. The vehicles navigated

00:00:45.500 --> 00:00:57.280
tight loading zones beside park trucks and cones, opening their upward swinging doors and rear

00:00:57.280 --> 00:01:02.080
