00:01:02.080 --> 00:01:07.680
dust conditions on a slick road. The sequences show the cars waiting for passengers to clear

00:01:07.680 --> 00:01:13.860
before merging back into flow. One sequence showed two cybercabs queuing with the trailing

00:01:13.860 --> 00:01:19.060
vehicle mirroring the lead car's stops before a passenger in a red cab approached the open

00:01:19.060 --> 00:01:25.780
door. The design features full with light bars, arrow wheel covers, Texas manufacturer plates,

00:01:25.780 --> 00:01:32.120
and no conventional mirrors or roof tads. These real-world operations demonstrate how the vehicles

00:01:32.120 --> 00:01:39.580
manage door timing, trunk access, and safe re-entry into traffic without extra sensors. Tesla scheduled

00:01:39.580 --> 00:01:45.840
a semi-event for September 24 at its Nevada factory. The gathering is expected to provide updates

00:01:45.840 --> 00:01:52.180
on production and customer deployments. Investors are watching for details on volume ramp and real-world

